  by: agent  # 2f27
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 2f27
  clock: 5  # 2f27
  nonce: 2f27  # 2f27
  message: "Cluster PR-B landed: WI-ribag done via PR #321. The shared read-path short-circuit + cache-policy is now substantially in place — PR-A scopes the --input read-path to the map's universe (no CWD re-walk), PR-B reads the 4x/16x comparison sketches from a stats sidecar instead of regenerating them (the dominant warm-sketch cost). Remaining: PR-C (WI-zipoj, P4) — >1M-LOC corpus-scale validation + a size-based default for the comparison-sketch path. INV-papuj closes after PR-C. Residual deferred (not an INV-papuj violation since it's not an ignored cache): symbol-centrality recompute within a single generate_sketch is not cached."  # 2f27
